      "content": "Fictional demonstration: Falcon Test Plan.\nOn 12 November 2026 the initial Falcon Test Plan remained unapproved because the sensor calibration was incomplete.\nMira Chen reviewed the Falcon Test Plan and requested a calibration retest.\nThe plan was not approved on 12 November 2026.\n",
      "content_validated_sha256": true
    },
