      "size_bytes": 280,
      "char_count": 280,
      "content": "Fictional demonstration: final Falcon Test Plan note.\nOn 13 November 2026, the calibration retest passed.\nElena Frost approved the Falcon Test Plan on 13 November 2026 after reviewing the completed calibration evidence.\nMira Chen was the initial reviewer, not the final approver.\n",
      "content_validated_sha256": true
    },
